        "faq": {
            "type": "airlight-lp-faq",
            "blocks": {
                "faq_1": {
                    "type": "faq_item",
                    "settings": {
                        "question": "How warm is the AirLight Jacket exactly?",
                        "answer": "<p>Thermographic testing at 3°C shows the AirLight Jacket reaches the same surface temperature as a traditional down jacket within 1 minute of wear. It's designed to cover you comfortably from around 0°C to 15°C depending on your activity level.</p>"
                    }
                },
                "faq_2": {
                    "type": "faq_item",
                    "settings": {
                        "question": "What exactly is kapok fiber?",
                        "answer": "<p>Kapok is a natural fiber harvested from the seed pods of the kapok tree, native to Southeast Asia. Unlike cotton, no tree cutting is required — the pods simply fall and the fluff is collected. The fiber is hollow, making it naturally lightweight and thermally efficient. KAPOK KNOT has developed a process to transform this fiber into a high-performance insulation sheet called EthicalDown Kapok™.</p>"
                    }
                },
                "faq_3": {
                    "type": "faq_item",
                    "settings": {
                        "question": "Is it machine washable?",
                        "answer": "<p>Yes. Unlike down jackets that require dry cleaning, the AirLight Jacket can be machine washed on a gentle, cold-water cycle. Kapok fiber does not clump or degrade with repeated washing.</p>"
                    }
                },
                "faq_4": {
                    "type": "faq_item",
                    "settings": {
                        "question": "What is your shipping and return policy?",
                        "answer": "<p>We offer <strong>free worldwide shipping</strong> for this launch offer (first 100 orders). Orders are dispatched within 3–5 business days from Japan. Please note that due to international shipping costs, we are unable to accept returns — but please reach out to us if there is any issue with your order.</p>"
                    }
                },
                "faq_5": {
                    "type": "faq_item",
                    "settings": {
                        "question": "How does sizing work?",
                        "answer": "<p>The AirLight Jacket is designed with a relaxed, slightly oversized fit. If you prefer a fitted look, we recommend sizing down. Detailed size charts are available on the product page.</p>"
                    }
                },
                "faq_6": {
                    "type": "faq_item",
                    "settings": {
                        "question": "Is KAPOK KNOT really sustainable?",
                        "answer": "<p>Yes, on multiple levels. Kapok requires no irrigation, no pesticides, and no tree cutting. Our founder personally maintains direct contracts with farms and processing facilities in Southeast Asia. Increased kapok demand also drives reforestation in the region.</p>"
                    }
                }
            },
